import ../../ui/input.dl

to get key {integer:key} is held in {a pointer to UI view:view}:
    return the item at key in (view's keys)

the UI R key means: 82
the UI Q key means: 81
the UI E key means: 69

to close a game from {a pointer to UI view:view}:
    if (view's input kind = 3) and (view's key press = the UI escape key):
        set view's closed to true
        set view's key press to -1
